<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 75.4499 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 75.4499 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.4499 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Thursday after 75.0100 on Tuesday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     Apr 24		  Apr 23</p>
<p> High			     75.4500		 75.0100</p>
<p> Low				75.3000		 74.4500</p>
<p> Open			     75.3500		 74.9000</p>
<p> Close			    75.4499		 75.0100</p>
<p> Volume ($ mln)		  2.760		   6.210</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
